 mi zannedersiniz? <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"229\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 228.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 51.0 51.0 57.7 73.6 80.3 80.3 89.3 107.3 107.3 117.7 117.7 124.6 131.3 138.0 138.0 144.7 153.7 153.7 160.6 160.6 160.6 167.3 174.7 190.6 197.3 204.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 42.0 57.7 80.3 89.3 131.3 197.3 204.0 212.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allah yaptıklarınızdan gafil değildir.</p>"}